; Parity corpus (synthetic data, S0094): plugins from the ledger's own folders. The root and an included file each
; set insert_pythonpath, so both folders are on the path; plugins are taken from the root file only (an included
; file's plugin line is ignored by Beancount), with and without a configuration; a module without __plugins__ is
; skipped; a missing module and a plugin that raises each give an error and the load goes on.
option "title" "Local plugins"
option "operating_currency" "USD"
option "insert_pythonpath" "TRUE"
include "sub/more.beancount"
plugin "parity_s0094_tagger" "parity"
plugin "parity_s0094_function_object"
plugin "parity_s0094_inert"
plugin "parity_s0094_not_installed"
plugin "parity_s0094_raises"
plugin "parity_s0094_from_sub"

2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash USD
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Food USD

2020-01-02 * "Shop" "lunch"
  Expenses:Food  7.00 USD
  Assets:Cash  -7.00 USD
